  "id": "ttm",
  "term": "TTM",
  "definition": "TTM stands for the Transtheoretical Model, a psychological framework that matches support or self-management plans to a person’s current stage of behavioral change. It is used to make interventions more relevant to individual needs and may help reduce information overload while improving effectiveness.",
